{"index":19,"kind":"p","text":"在一次方程$x+2y=1$中，用$y$表示变量$x$并把表示式$1-2y$代入方程组的第一个方程替换$x$后，得到和原方程组同解的方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}(1-2y)^2-3(1-2y)y-2y^2+5(1-2y)-7y+10=0,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#9","p0050#1"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":20,"kind":"p","text":"化简第一个方程后，方程组具有下列形式：\n$\\begin{cases}y^2-3y+2=0,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#2"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":21,"kind":"p","text":"由二次方程$y^2-3y+2=0$得出$y=1$或$y=2$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#3"],"changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":22,"kind":"p","text":"因此，$\\begin{cases}y=1,\\\\x=1-2y\\end{cases}$ 或 $\\begin{cases}y=2,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#4"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":23,"kind":"p","text":"于是，$\\begin{cases}x=-1,\\\\y=1\\end{cases}$ 或 $\\begin{cases}x=-3,\\\\y=2.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#5"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":24,"kind":"p","text":"答：\n$\\{(-1,1),(-3,2)\\}$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#6"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":25,"kind":"p","text":"代入消元法和图解法、加减消元法一样，也可以用来解二元线性方程组.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":43,"source_refs":["p0050#7"],"changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
